		line=1037,
	},
	{
		{"text"},
		line=1038,
	},
	{
		{"eval", exp="g.no317=1"},
		{"exflgchk"},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=3000, wait=1500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"vo", id=1, stop=1},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"skipstop"},
		{"skipstop"},
		{"skipstop"},
		{"bg", del=1, path=":cg/07/", file="ed710010", time=3000},
		{"wa", time=5000},
		{"bg", del=1, path=":bg/", file="bg_0000", time=3000},
		{"skipstop"},
		{"exreturn"},
		line=1038,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Backdropped by a lively chorus of cicadas, I open the door to the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“'Scuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, hello. Sure is hot today, hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I worked up a sweat just walking...”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"I awkwardly trail off, at a complete loss for words.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Elsa is the only one here in the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Just as usual, she's studiously working away at the paperwork on her desk.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"─In her ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"swimsuit.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Umm, so...”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No need to point it out, thank you very much.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I was overseeing the water main repairs, and out of nowhere, I got drenched from head to toe.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And so, I needed an outfit to wear while my uniform dries.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Hence the swimsuit. Makes sense.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I thought maybe you were just incredibly bad with heat.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If I was, I would've turned the AC up.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now, now, that's enough worrying about me. Go ahead and get to your work.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Affirmative.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"I take my usual seat and begin my student council work.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"The sound of Elsa's typing echoes throughout the room.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"I know it's rude to stare, but based on how our desks are arranged, she's right in my field of view.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"It's been a while since the two of us have become lovers, and I've seen her naked many times now.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Even so, clad only in her swimsuit, she has an entirely different sort of charm about her.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Perhaps it could be called this sense of mystique at barely being unable to see everything?",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What do you think you're looking at?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry. I can't stop my eyes from wandering.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You've already seen me naked plenty of times, haven't you?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Still, a swimsuit is totally different.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As different as chilled versus hot tofu.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I don't get it.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then what if I were in my swimsuit?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Try me.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why bother speculating when you can just go ahead and do it?”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We had swim class today, so you should have your swimsuit with you, isn't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"I briskly change into my swimsuit and sit back down at my desk.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"We continue our work in silence for a while, but gradually, Elsa is visibly losing her cool.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa, would you mind signing this?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"I ask, approaching Elsa with a document in hand.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...H-Hey, don't stand so close.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How else am I supposed to get your signature?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well... you have a point, but...”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Elsa averts her gaze as a blush crosses her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...You win this time. You're right, I can't keep my focus with you in your swimsuit like that.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Anyways, it's all that ridiculously tight swimsuit's fault.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're hardly one to talk, practically bursting at the seams like that.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hweh?!”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Elsa hastily covers her chest with her arms.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You were looking at me like ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"that?",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't think any man could help himself. Especially not your lover of all people.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Elsa stares at me wordlessly for several moments.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Heh, hehehehee... oh, what am I going to do with you?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I meant what I said.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I know. I only fell in love with you because you're so honest like that.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Unprompted, Elsa gently takes my hand into her own.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Her upturned eyes crinkle with a mischievous grin.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...How about taking a little break?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We've barely gotten anything done in the first place, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even more reason to, in that case.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Even a simpleton like me understands what she's getting at.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"She wants to be intimate with me, here and now.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not a bad idea.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"I lean over and close in on Elsa's face with my own.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahhh, what a mightily hot day it─”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Kotone bursts into the room and promptly freezes on the spot.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Sh-Shiinoha-san?!”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“H-H-How obscene!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Donning swimsuits for such perverse purposes?! And in the student council office?!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I-It's not what it looks like!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How, pray tell, is this not exactly what it looks like?!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"It is, in fact, exactly what it looks like.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“U-Umm, you see...”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You may be unaware of this, Shiinoha-san, but this is in fact a revered Republican tradition.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“On particularly hot days, we pay our respects by spending all day in our swimsuits.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-Is that truly the case?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Kotone looks incredulously at me for confirmation.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"As Elsa's lover, I ought to back her up.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"After all, I'm just as implicated as she is.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It may seem strange to us, but this is a tradition that's been around for a long time in the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The times are changing, and we should learn to respect each other's cultures.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So I took the initiative to change into my swimsuit myself.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I see... How open-minded of you, Soujin-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In that case, I shall be back momentarily!”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ta-da! What say you two?!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, you look wonderful, Shiinoha-san. I'm sure the sun god is very pleased.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Once you go ahead and take the plunge, it is actually remarkably pleasant.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“R-Right?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"And then there were three.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"I feel sorry for her, but we've come too far at this point to spill the beans.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Morning.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“'Scuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Please excuse us.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Welcome! We have been awaiting your presence!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? What dimension did I just step into?”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whatever might you mean? Why, this is a most time-honored observance.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...I beg your pardon?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone, can you pass me those documents?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Right away, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kanami, could you check over these for me?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Ah, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"And then there were six.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"I can't believe they all swallowed our harebrained lie.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Are you sure about this?)”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(It's too late to back down now. Even lies can become truth if you push them hard enough.)”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Committed to doubling down, Elsa goes about her work as usual.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Right, I need to steel myself as well.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"If I think of it as paying homage to the sun god, swimsuits are truly no big deal. Yep.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Even beset on all sides by swimsuit-clad girls, I shan't have any indecent thoughts!",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Indeed. My heart is a lake of tranquil stillness.)”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(All is well. My heart is as unto an unblemished mirror.)”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(...I-Indeed.)”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(...)”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"My heart is... completely in tatters...",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Howdy there, ladies!”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"An unusual visitor makes her appearance as I desperately try in vain to cast away my worldly desires.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Sh-Shino?!”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yours truly.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Shino incredulously surveys the room.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“My, my, what a wonderful way to beat the heat.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Now then, how in the heck did you come up with this idea?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Allow me to enlighten you!”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah, hey!”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In accordance with Elsa-sama's proposition, we have decided to spend the day in our swimsuits.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Why, it is a most venerable Republican tradition for paying our respects to the sun god!”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hmmm?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Shino chuckles wickedly to herself.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Having lived in the Republic before, Shino probably sees right through Elsa's charade.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Shino, please... Just this one time...)”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Elsa makes a silent plea with her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Ah, now I remember. I did this myself back in the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's real embarrassing at first, but it's really not so bad once you get used to it... Don'tcha think, Elsa?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah! We even did it together!”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That reminds me─this tradition has a fun little twist.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“We're gonna do it today, aren't we?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...Wh-Why, but of course!”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do what?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Well y'see, right when the sun sets, we're gonna kill the lights so the room's totally dark.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And then...”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“A-And then?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“On the count of three, we all shout out the name of the person we love most.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Pfft!”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Man, just thinking back to it brings back so many memories. Riiight, Elsa?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Aha, hahahaha...”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And wouldn't you know it, the sun just so happens to be setting right now.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'll join in on the fun, so let's give it a whirl.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Shino smugly reaches for the light switch.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Soujin, stop her!)”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shino, I'm sure there's some of us who'd prefer to not say it.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yep, and that's why we kill the lights.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Nobody'll be able to tell who shouted what.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"With that, Shino gleefully flicks off the lights.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"At this rate, the object of everyone's affections will be laid bare.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"For Elsa's, and everyone else's sake, I have to put a stop to this somehow.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Alrighty ladies, are y'ready?”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, if it's in the dark, we should be fine.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I-I got this!”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“On your marks, ladies!”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“One... two... three!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I LOVE YOU, ELSAAAAA!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Amid the darkness, I banish my shame and scream out as loudly as I can.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Anything the other girls said─",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"was completely drowned out; even Elsa's voice right next to me.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"When the lights turn back on, the first thing I spot is a gaggle of awfully displeased-looking girls.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, couldn't you have kept it down a little?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“The only voice I could hear was Onii-sama's.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Despite their apparent indignation, however, they all look rather relieved.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Aww man... Soujin just haaad to go and ruin all the fun.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, I might've got a bit too into it.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Soujin... Thank you.)”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Did I at least minimize the damage?)”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(Yes, plenty.)”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, well, aren't you two just getting along swimmingly.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Whatcha say, Elsa? How's it feel to have your name screamed out loud like that?”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehee, how could I not be happy?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I wish you all the happiness in the world.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, how enviable! Hotori-sama, let us both keep up the good fight!”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“N-No need to tell me. A true warrior never throws in the towel.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Though my shout may have drowned them out, everyone else still surely named the object of their affections.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"I'm awfully curious, but I suppose it'd be best to let sleeping dogs lie.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well then, now that the sun's finally set, shall we go and get changed?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Heeding Elsa's suggestion, the rest of the girls follow her to the locker room.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"The sole exception being the uniform-clad Shino, who quickly catches up to Elsa right before she leaves.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“(Girl, you're gonna have it real rough. You've suuuure got plenty of rivals.)”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(What do you mean?)”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“(I've got a good pair of ears, you know.)”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"The last sight I see of Shino before she leaves is her suggestively flicking her earlobes at me.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Unfortunately, I wasn't able to catch whatever it was that Shino whispered to her.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
